This product generates *invented* people, facilities, and clinical-looking
fields for software testing. It is not a real patient, provider, or AHCA
registry. Do not treat output as PHI. Do not mix it with real health records.

Optional Synthea CSV import is based on MITRE Synthea
(https://github.com/synthetichealth/synthea), Apache-2.0.
Faker (https://github.com/joke2k/faker) is used for Florida-scoped names
and addresses.
